WEBVTT

00:04:58.829 --> 00:05:02.454
had major reductions in protein build-ups,

00:05:02.454 --> 00:05:04.996
amyloid plaques and tau tangles

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:08.121
that are hallmarks
of Alzheimer's progression.

00:05:08.788 --> 00:05:12.621
The stimulation preserved
more of the connections

00:05:12.663 --> 00:05:17.329
or synapses that bind
nerve cells into circuits.

00:05:18.913 --> 00:05:23.413
More cells survived,
so the brain decayed less.

00:05:24.454 --> 00:05:29.746
The brain naturally has open spaces
known as ventricles.